    "text": "By WKRC ,\n5 hours ago CINCINNATI (WKRC) - The Hamilton County Coroner’s Office is seeking relatives or friends of a Cincinnati man who recently passed away. Robert Cummins, 65, who most recently lived in an apartment on Spring Grove Ave. He died on Oct. 31. Anyone with information is asked to contact Chief Investigator... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
